# Large Binary Data (Files >100MB exceed GitHub push limits)
# LDEM_80S_80M.IMG is ~115MB. The label (.LBL) and catalog (.CAT) are tracked.
# To compute custom coordinates offline, download LDEM_80S_80M.IMG from official NASA PDS:
# https://imbrium.mit.edu/DATA/LOLA_GDR/POLAR/IMG/LDEM_80S_80M.IMG
data/terrain-source/*.IMG
